<BaseLayout title="The Fool — The False Creator">
  <main class="page"><a href="/" class="back">← THE FALSE CREATOR</a><p class="eyebrow">PHILOSOPHY / 001</p><h1>The Fool.</h1><p class="lead">The freedom to begin before certainty arrives.</p><p>The Fool is not the person who knows nothing. It is the person willing to move while knowing that knowledge is incomplete — curious enough to test the world, humble enough to be changed by what happens.</p><a href="/philosophy/" class="back">← BACK TO PHILOSOPHY</a></main>
